stream
BT /F2 20 Tf 72 730 Td (Grandma's Goulash) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 695 Td 17 TL
(Serves 6. Takes about 3 hours, most of it waiting.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1 kg beef shank, cut into cubes) Tj T*
(3 large onions, finely chopped) Tj T*
(3 tbsp sweet paprika) Tj T*
(1 tsp caraway seeds, crushed) Tj T*
(2 cloves garlic) Tj T*
(2 peppers and 1 tomato, chopped) Tj T*
(500 g potatoes, cubed) Tj T*
(Salt, lard or oil) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Cook the onions slowly in the fat until golden. Do not rush this.) Tj T*
(2. Take the pot off the heat and stir in the paprika.) Tj T*
(3. Add the beef, garlic, caraway, salt, and enough water to cover.) Tj T*
(4. Simmer on low heat for 2 hours, adding water when needed.) Tj T*
(5. Add peppers, tomato, and potatoes. Cook 30 more minutes.) Tj T*
(6. Taste. It probably needs more paprika.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
